<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">1. The above concolidated financial results of the Company have been reviewed by the Audit Committee and approved by the Board at their meetings held on 06.02.2023.   2. The consolidated financial results have been prepared in accordance with the companies ( accounting standards ) Rules 2013, read with relevant rules issued thereunder and other recognised accounting practises and policies to the extent applicable. The Unaudited financial results relatess to Bal Pharma Ltd and its subsidiaries ( togather constitute the group) .   3. The group has not receieved any intimation with regards to its vendors registered as Miicro, small and Medium enterprises . Accordengly entire dues to vendors  has been classified as payable to other then MSME's.   4. The figures for the quarter ended December 31,2022 are the balancing figures between audited figures in respect of full financial year and unaudited published year to date figures upto the 3rd quarter of the relevant financial year which were subjected to limited review by statutory auditors.   5. The company has only one reportable segment i.e Pharmaceuticles.   6. The Company has filed application with NCLT for merger of Golden Drugs Pvt Ltd , its wholly owned subsidiary.   7. During the quarter under review, the BOard has made the allotment 117500 equity shares to the employees of the Company pursuant to exercise of stock options.   8. Previous period figures has been regrouped / rearranged wherever considered necessary to confirm to the period presentation.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
